{'symbol': 'ATO', 'date': '2019-11-05 22:30:00', 'title': 'ATMOS ENERGY CORPORATION DECLARES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND, PAYABLE ON DECEMBER 9, 2019', 'text': 'ATMOS ENERGY CORPORATION ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND INCREASE ON THE COMPANY’S COMMON STOCK TO $0.575 CENTS PER SHARE. THE FISCAL 2020 INDICATED ANNUAL DIVIDEND IS $2.30. THE FISCAL 2019 ANNUAL DIVIDEND WAS $2.10. THE DIVIDEND WILL BE PAID ON DECEMBER 9, 2019, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD ON NOVEMBER 25, 2019.'}